<title>USA: Quantum sees flat revenue in March quarter.</title>
<headline>Quantum sees flat revenue in March quarter.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quantum Corp.'s revenue will show little change in its fiscal fourth quarter ending March compared with its fiscal third quarter, the disk drive maker's chief executive said Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Most of the market analysts for the disk drive business are looking for a flat quarter,&quot; which means Quantum, the second-biggest disk drive maker, also will have flat revenues, CEO Michael Brown said.</p>
</text>
